आत्मसात् ind. In oneʼs own possession, oneʼs own; mostly in combination
 with कृ or भू; ˚कृ to appropriate to oneself, take for oneself;
 दुरितैरपि कर्तुमात्मसात् R. 8. 2 to bring under subjection or power;
 so ˚भू come under oneʼs subjection.
